    "Today's Drop is ready: your squad's best picks.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Today's Drop está listo: lo mejor de tu escuadrón."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Today's Drop est prêt : les meilleures sélections de ton équipe."
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Today's Drop이 준비됐어요: 우리 팀의 베스트 추천이에요."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Today's Dropの準備ができました。あなたのチームのおすすめです。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Today's Drop 已就绪:你的小队精选好物。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Today's Drop 準備好了：你的偵察隊最佳精選。"
          }
        },
        "vi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Today's Drop đã sẵn sàng: những lựa chọn hay nhất của đội bạn."
          }
        },
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Today's Drop sudah siap: pilihan terbaik tim scout-mu."
          }
        },
        "th": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Today's Drop พร้อมแล้ว: ของเด็ดจากทีมของคุณ"
          }
        },
        "fil": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ready na ang Today's Drop: ang best picks ng squad mo."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Today's Drop तैयार है: आपके स्क्वाड की सबसे बढ़िया पसंद।"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Too pricey": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Muy caro"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Trop cher"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "너무 비싸요"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "高すぎる"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "太贵了"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "太貴了"
          }
        },
        "vi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Quá đắt"
          }
        },
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Terlalu mahal"
          }
        },
        "th": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "แพงไป"
          }
        },
        "fil": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Masyadong mahal"
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "बहुत महंगा"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Too pricey, wrong style, not your brand: every reason sharpens the next hunt. The more you react, the better it gets.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Muy caro, estilo equivocado, no es tu marca: cada motivo mejora la próxima búsqueda. Mientras más reaccionas, mejor funciona."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Trop cher, mauvais style, pas ta marque : chaque raison affine la prochaine chasse. Plus tu réagis, mieux ça marche."
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "너무 비싸거나, 스타일이 아니거나, 맘에 안 드는 브랜드거나, 어떤 이유든 다음 탐색이 더 정확해져요. 반응할수록 더 좋아져요."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "高すぎる、スタイルが違う、好みのブランドじゃない。どんな理由も次の探索を磨きます。リアクションするほど精度が上がります。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "太贵、风格不对、不是你的品牌:每个原因都会让下次搜寻更精准。你反馈得越多,效果越好。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "太貴、風格不對、不是你愛的品牌：每個原因都會讓下次搜尋更精準。你回應越多，結果越好。"
          }
        },
        "vi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Quá đắt, sai phong cách, không hợp thương hiệu: mỗi lý do đều giúp lần săn sau chuẩn hơn. Bạn phản hồi càng nhiều, kết quả càng hay."
          }
        },
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Terlalu mahal, gayanya salah, bukan brand-mu: setiap alasan mempertajam perburuan berikutnya. Makin sering kamu bereaksi, makin bagus hasilnya."
          }
        },
        "th": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "แพงไป สไตล์ไม่ใช่ ไม่ใช่แบรนด์ที่ชอบ ทุกเหตุผลช่วยให้ล่าครั้งต่อไปแม่นขึ้น ยิ่งแสดงความรู้สึกมาก ยิ่งเจอของที่ใช่"
          }
        },
        "fil": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Masyadong mahal, mali ang style, hindi mo brand: bawat dahilan ay nagpapatalas sa susunod na hunt. Mas marami kang react, mas gumagaling."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "बहुत महंगा, स्टाइल गलत, ब्रांड पसंद नहीं: हर वजह अगली खोज को और सटीक बनाती है। जितना रिएक्ट करेंगे, उतना बेहतर होगा।"
          }
        }
      }
    },
