    "e.g. New Balance 990s in grey or earth tones, size 10.5, under $200. Also hunting a vintage Carhartt chore coat.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "p. ej., New Balance 990 en gris o tonos tierra, talla 10.5, por menos de $200. También busco un chaquetón Carhartt vintage."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ex. New Balance 990 grises ou terre, pointure 44, moins de 200 $. Je cherche aussi une veste Carhartt vintage."
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "예: 회색이나 어스 톤 New Balance 990, 사이즈 10.5, 200달러 이하. 빈티지 Carhartt 초어 코트도 찾고 있어요."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "例如:灰色或大地色的 New Balance 990,10.5 码,200 美元以内。也在找一件复古 Carhartt 工装外套。"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "例：ニューバランス990のグレーかアースカラー、10.5、200ドル以下。ヴィンテージのCarharttのチョアコートも探しています。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "例如：灰色或大地色系的 New Balance 990，10.5 號，預算 200 美元以內。也在找復古 Carhartt 工作外套。"
          }
        },
        "vi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "vd: New Balance 990 màu xám hoặc tông đất, size 10.5, dưới $200. Đang săn thêm một chiếc áo khoác Carhartt chore coat vintage."
          }
        },
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "mis. New Balance 990 warna abu-abu atau earth tone, ukuran 10.5, di bawah $200. Juga mencari jaket chore Carhartt vintage."
          }
        },
        "th": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "เช่น New Balance 990 สีเทาหรือโทนเอิร์ธ ไซส์ 10.5 ไม่เกิน $200 และกำลังตามหา Carhartt chore coat วินเทจด้วย"
          }
        },
        "fil": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "hal. New Balance 990s na grey o earth tones, size 10.5, wala pang $200. Naghahanap din ng vintage na Carhartt chore coat."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "जैसे: New Balance 990 ग्रे या अर्थ टोन में, साइज़ 10.5, $200 से कम। साथ ही एक विंटेज Carhartt चोर कोट भी खोज रहा हूँ।"
          }
        }
      }
    },
