    "“Vintage Rolex Datejust 36, champagne dial, under $6k” finds far more than “watches.”": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "“Rolex Datejust 36 vintage, esfera champán, por menos de $6k” encuentra mucho más que “relojes”."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "« Rolex Datejust 36 vintage, cadran champagne, moins de 6 000 $ » trouve bien plus que « montres »."
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "“빈티지 Rolex Datejust 36, 샴페인 다이얼, 6천 달러 이하”처럼 쓰면 “시계”보다 훨씬 많이 찾아요."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "“Vintage Rolex Datejust 36,香槟色表盘,6000 美元以内”比“手表”能找到的多得多。"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "「ヴィンテージ ロレックス デイトジャスト 36、シャンパンダイヤル、6,000ドル以下」と探す方が、「腕時計」よりずっと多く見つかります。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "「Vintage Rolex Datejust 36，香檳色錶盤，6 千美元以內」比「手錶」能找到多更多。"
          }
        },
        "vi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "“Vintage Rolex Datejust 36, mặt số champagne, dưới $6k” tìm ra nhiều hơn hẳn “đồng hồ”."
          }
        },
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "“Vintage Rolex Datejust 36, dial champagne, di bawah $6k” menemukan jauh lebih banyak daripada “jam tangan.”"
          }
        },
        "th": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "“Vintage Rolex Datejust 36 หน้าปัดแชมเปญ ราคาไม่เกิน $6k” เจอของได้มากกว่า “นาฬิกา” เยอะ"
          }
        },
        "fil": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mas marami kang mahahanap sa “Vintage Rolex Datejust 36, champagne dial, wala pang $6k” kaysa sa “watches.”"
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "“विंटेज Rolex Datejust 36, शैम्पेन डायल, $6k से कम” खोजने पर “घड़ियाँ” से कहीं ज़्यादा नतीजे मिलते हैं।"
          }
        }
      }
    },
